2
00:01:12,431 --> 00:01:21,931
まもなく、大神ミオ5周年記念ライブ「ナイトループ」スタートします。
Coming up soon, Ookami Mio's 5th Anniversary Live "Night Loop" will begin.

3
00:01:23,531 --> 00:01:30,131
ライブのコンセプトは、アルバムのテーマと同じ夜です。
The concept of this live is night, just like the theme of the album.

4
00:01:31,031 --> 00:01:37,331
是非最後までごゆっくりお楽しみください。
Please sit back and enjoy it all the way to the end.

5
00:02:54,831 --> 00:03:02,331
2018年から5年間、通り過ぎてきたたくさんの夜。
The many nights I've passed through over the five years since 2018.

6
00:03:03,331 --> 00:03:07,431
長かったような、短かったような。
It felt long, yet it felt short.

7
00:03:08,131 --> 00:03:16,231
何度でも繰り返したいような…繰り返したい…
Like I want to repeat it any number of times... want to repeat...

8
00:03:16,931 --> 00:03:20,631
君はこのループから抜け出したいの？
Do you want to escape from this loop?

9
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:35,800
聴こえますか 聴こえますか
Can you hear me? Can you hear me?

10
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:49,800
ハロー ハロー 聴こえますか そっちは何年？
Hello, hello, can you hear me? What year is it over there?

11
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:58,500
正しく分かり合う手段は一つじゃないさ
There isn't just one way to truly understand each other.

12
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:03,200
漂う時間は何処へ行くのか
Where does this drifting time go?

13
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:07,000
さよならはいつ誰が決めるの
Who decides when it's time to say goodbye?

14
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:12,000
その手に触れようと願ってる 本当さ
Hoping to touch your hand, truly.

15
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:21,500
永遠の夜光 君に歌う 世界中が君にいじわるでも
Eternal nocturnal light, I sing to you even if the whole world is mean to you.

16
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:28,000
思い出して 覚えていて まぶたの裏 ずっとまた会えるからね
Remember, keep it in mind, behind your eyelids, we can always meet again.

17
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:33,200
穏やかに 健やかに 流れ続け
Calmly, healthily, continuing to flow.

18
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:39,500
君だって私だって 消えるのは言葉だけ
You and I, the only things that vanish are words.

19
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,500
ふんわり君を抱きしめてあげるからね
I'll gently hold you in my arms.

20
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:51,000
泣かないで
Don't cry.

21
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:59,800
延々と続く今日は 絶景のようで 突然の幸せまで
This endless today feels like a picturesque view, right up to sudden happiness.

22
00:05:00,016 --> 00:05:03,466
当然の幸せでも 狂わせるんだ
Even ordinary happiness, it drives us wild...

23
00:05:03,966 --> 00:05:05,666
忘れないで
Don't forget.

24
00:05:06,066 --> 00:05:09,236
何処へだって繋がる 回線
A line that connects anywhere at all.

25
00:05:09,796 --> 00:05:13,226
寂しい宇宙と オレンジの公園
A lonely universe and an orange park.

26
00:05:13,796 --> 00:05:18,536
慕わしい心の限りを 歌おう
Let's sing out all our yearning hearts!

27
00:05:19,476 --> 00:05:22,436
永遠の夜光 届くよね
Eternal night light, it reaches you, right?

28
00:05:23,376 --> 00:05:27,696
幻想よりも 優しいかたちのまま
Remaining in a form gentler than any illusion.

29
00:05:27,886 --> 00:05:30,236
濡れそぼる その頬を
That damp cheek of yours...

30
00:05:30,716 --> 00:05:35,426
こっそりなでて 乾かしてあげるからね
I'll secretly stroke and dry it for you.

31
00:05:35,616 --> 00:05:46,896
何度だって 何度だって
No matter how many times, no matter how many times...

32
00:05:55,456 --> 00:05:59,916
永遠の夜光 ここに歌う 会いたいよ
Eternal night light, singing here, I want to see you.

33
00:06:00,036 --> 00:06:03,216
消えたくなないよ 思い出して
I don't want to disappear, please remember.

34
00:06:03,396 --> 00:06:07,146
覚えていて 今ここで 笑い合ったことを
Please keep it in mind, right here where we laughed together.

35
00:06:09,936 --> 00:06:13,696
永遠の夜光 君に歌う
Eternal night light, singing to you.

36
00:06:13,926 --> 00:06:19,486
世界中が 君にいじわるでも 思い出して 覚えていて
Even if the whole world is mean to you, remember it, keep it in mind.

37
00:06:21,066 --> 00:06:24,726
まぶたの裏 ずっとまた会えるからね
Behind your eyelids, we can always meet again.

38
00:06:24,946 --> 00:06:29,906
さよならは さよならは ねぇ 誰かが
Goodbyes, goodbyes... Hey, who was it that...

39
00:06:30,096 --> 00:06:34,416
決めるもの 消えるのは 言葉だけ
Decided... What disappears is only words.

40
00:06:34,716 --> 00:06:39,966
ふんわり君を 抱きしめてあげるからね 泣かないで
Gently, I will hold you close, so don't cry.

41
00:06:40,086 --> 00:06:42,516
泣かないで
Don't cry.

42
00:07:23,238 --> 00:07:27,428
残された呼吸を 使い果たせば
If we use up the breath we have left...

43
00:07:27,508 --> 00:07:33,308
抱き留めた記憶さえ 灰へと散る 鼓動とは
Even the memories we held onto scatter to ash. What is a heartbeat?

44
00:07:34,908 --> 00:07:37,358
呪いだと 気づきながら
Realizing it's a curse...

45
00:07:37,458 --> 00:07:42,158
惨烈さを笑い行く うつろな瞳
With hollow eyes, laughing at the brutality.

46
00:07:42,308 --> 00:07:48,858
その叫びもやがて過去に溶ける 暗室の花だけを道連れに
That cry will soon melt into the past, with only the flower of the darkroom as a companion.

47
00:07:49,108 --> 00:07:56,558
嫌だよ 終わるために生まれた 悲劇など
I hate it—tragedies born just to end!

48
00:07:56,708 --> 00:08:02,358
息を止めて そのままで 命よ銀に光れ
Hold your breath, just like that—O life, shine in silver!

49
00:08:02,508 --> 00:08:07,508
果てなき夢が いつまでも 続きますように
May this endless dream continue forever...

50
00:08:07,758 --> 00:08:12,758
消えたくないよ 消えないで ただそれだけを祈った
I don't want to disappear, please don't fade away—that was all I prayed for.

51
00:08:13,058 --> 00:08:18,858
最後の 最後の 幸せ
Our very last, our very last happiness...

52
00:08:19,108 --> 00:08:24,458
誰にも 誰にも 奪わせない 離さない
I won't let anyone, anyone take it away. I won't let go!

53
00:08:36,258 --> 00:08:41,808
造られた 世界は 閉じられているか
Is this crafted world closed off?

54
00:08:41,958 --> 00:08:47,308
目を背け 死神に 買われたのは
Turning our eyes away, what was bought by the reaper...

55
00:08:47,608 --> 00:08:53,958
揺れる火の 鮮やかさを 持て余す頃 白蝋は
When we struggle with the brilliance of flickering fire, white wax...

56
00:08:54,108 --> 00:08:59,858
泣き続ける その結末を 思い出して
Keeps weeping. Remember that conclusion.

57
00:08:59,958 --> 00:09:09,158
朝を迎えるのは あと何日だろう 恐いは届かず朽ちてゆくその日が
How many days until the morning comes? The fearful day that rots away without reaching anything...

58
00:09:09,458 --> 00:09:15,558
息を止めて そのままで 命よ銀に光れ
Hold your breath, just like that—O life, shine in silver!

59
00:09:15,808 --> 00:09:20,808
優しい歌が いつまでも 響きますように
May this gentle song echo on forever...

60
00:09:21,058 --> 00:09:26,708
悲しみも いつか隠さるのなら いつかはでを繰り返す
If even sadness is hidden away someday, we'll repeat our farewells.

61
00:09:27,008 --> 00:09:32,408
こんなに こんなに ささやかだ
So simple, so simple...

62
00:09:32,708 --> 00:09:39,158
最後の 最後の 願いごと
Our very last, our very last wish...

63
00:10:00,426 --> 00:10:04,046
それを守るだけの力が 在ればよかった
If I only had the power to protect that...

64
00:10:04,306 --> 00:10:07,146
静かな夕凪をずっと見ていたかった
I wanted to keep watching the quiet calm.

65
00:10:07,406 --> 00:10:09,926
それを守るだけの力が在ればよかった
If I only had the power to protect that...

66
00:10:10,066 --> 00:10:15,546
安らかな日々だけが続けばよかった
I just wanted peaceful days to go on.

67
00:10:15,546 --> 00:10:20,686
すべてを捧げても
Even if I dedicate everything...

68
00:10:24,026 --> 00:10:26,166
息を止めてそのままに
Holding my breath just as I am,

69
00:10:26,166 --> 00:10:29,086
命を銀に光らせ
Making my life shine in silver,

70
00:10:29,086 --> 00:10:33,746
果てなき夢がいつまでも続きますように
May this endless dream continue forever...

71
00:10:34,086 --> 00:10:40,466
消えたくないよ消えないでただそれだけを祈った
I don't want it to fade, please don't fade, that's all I prayed for.

72
00:10:40,466 --> 00:10:45,326
最後の最後の幸せ
My very last happiness...

73
00:10:46,026 --> 00:10:54,686
それでもそれでも触れるなら許さない
Even so, if I can reach out and touch you, I won't let you go.

74
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:36,580
雨、やまないな。
The rain isn't stopping.

75
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,760
みおちゃーん！
Mio-chan!

76
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:43,720
あやめ！こんなとこで何してんの？
Ayame! What are you doing in a place like this?

77
00:11:43,920 --> 00:11:48,360
あやめこそこんなとこで会うなんて奇遇だね。
Mio, you're one to talk. What a coincidence bumping into you here.

78
00:11:57,670 --> 00:12:00,270
雨、やまないね。
The rain really isn't stopping.

79
00:12:00,630 --> 00:12:02,130
そうだね。
Yeah, it really isn't.

80
00:12:05,710 --> 00:12:09,690
雨だけど、あやちゃんに会えて嬉しいな。
Even though it's raining, I'm so happy I got to see Aya-chan.

81
00:12:10,530 --> 00:12:13,670
あやめ、なんかあった？
Mio, did something happen?

82
00:12:14,090 --> 00:12:16,310
なんもないよ！
Nothing at all!

83
00:12:16,650 --> 00:12:19,510
嘘嘘！うちもあやめに会えて嬉しいよ。
No way! I'm happy I got to see Mio too, you know.

84
00:12:20,590 --> 00:12:23,790
もうちょっとお話したいな。
I want to talk a bit more.

85
00:12:24,490 --> 00:12:25,610
うん！
Yeah!

86
00:12:42,356 --> 00:12:45,696
ああ全然できてないなぁ、漏らす吐息、溜息
Ah, I'm totally failing... letting out sighs and heavy breaths.

87
00:12:48,076 --> 00:12:53,316
雨音響いていく午前0時、明けない夜願っている
The sound of rain echoes at midnight, wishing for a night that never ends.

88
00:12:54,696 --> 00:12:59,216
少しだけこのままで、ココロ、夜と雨の中
Just a little longer like this, with my heart in the night and the rain.

89
00:13:04,236 --> 00:13:10,216
揺れる想い まだ整理途中、流れる時間の中
Shaking feelings still in the middle of being sorted out, amidst the flowing time.

90
00:13:18,976 --> 00:13:24,176
明日晴れたらいいな、そんな些細な願いごと
I hope it's sunny tomorrow—such a trivial wish,

91
00:13:24,176 --> 00:13:30,016
カタチにして集めよう、夜照らすムーンライト
given shape and gathered up, under the moonlight illuminating the night.

92
00:13:35,056 --> 00:13:40,656
空を泳ぐ、顔上げて前へ、踏み出していこう
Swimming through the sky, look up and forward, let's take a step ahead.

93
00:13:41,256 --> 00:13:45,336
夜と雨の先、出口はまだ
Beyond the night and the rain, the exit is still...

94
00:13:49,096 --> 00:13:52,496
ああ全然変わらないなぁ、漏れる軽い微笑み
Ah, nothing has changed at all, with a leaking, light smile.

95
00:13:55,096 --> 00:14:00,136
液晶を見つめる午前3時、楽しいコト悲しいコト
Staring at the screen at 3 AM, happy things, sad things,

96
00:14:02,956 --> 00:14:06,976
ひとつに丸めちゃって、夜の中に置いておくの
rolled up into one, and left behind in the night.

97
00:14:11,096 --> 00:14:17,196
「頑張ろう」とか「できるよ」とか、無責任な言葉たち
Irresponsible words like "Do your best" or "You can do it"

98
00:14:21,856 --> 00:14:28,336
イヤになるから真っすぐに進みたいよ、流れる時間の中
get on my nerves, so I just want to walk straight ahead, amidst the flowing time.

99
00:14:36,796 --> 00:14:42,576
駆けだす、明日会えたらどんな顔するかな、朝日みたいな笑顔で
Running off—wondering what face I'll make if I see you tomorrow, with a smile like the morning sun.

100
00:14:48,076 --> 00:14:53,316
迎えて、夜照らすムーンライト、街を眺む
Welcoming it, the moonlight illuminating the night, gazing out at the town.

101
00:14:53,956 --> 00:14:59,216
悩みすら全部見透かすように、降り止まないまま
As if seeing right through all my worries, while the rain keeps falling endlessly...

102
00:16:37,406 --> 00:16:41,376
あたたかい雪が降る
Warm snow is falling

103
00:16:41,896 --> 00:16:45,336
不思議な場所
in a mysterious place.

104
00:16:46,246 --> 00:16:50,066
デジャヴみたい
It feels like déjà vu.

105
00:16:51,296 --> 00:16:55,266
真っ白な夜
A pure white night,

106
00:16:56,116 --> 00:17:00,076
ぽつりと咲いている
blooming all alone

107
00:17:00,436 --> 00:17:04,306
赤い頬の
with red cheeks—

108
00:17:05,126 --> 00:17:09,136
私見つけて
I found myself.

109
00:17:09,866 --> 00:17:15,026
つかれたね かなしいね
I'm so tired, so sad.

110
00:17:15,576 --> 00:17:22,776
もうやめたいね でもふりしぼって
I want to stop, but gathering my strength...

111
00:17:23,026 --> 00:17:28,506
私へとたどりついてくれて
you finally reached me.

112
00:17:28,756 --> 00:17:29,856
ありがとう
Thank you.

113
00:17:30,006 --> 00:17:38,236
あなたを待っていたのずっとここで
I've been waiting for you right here all this time.

114
00:17:39,136 --> 00:17:47,386
世界が目覚めてもそばにいさせて
Even if the world wakes up, let me stay by your side.

115
00:17:48,086 --> 00:17:56,476
あなたのために咲くよずっとここで
I will bloom just for you, right here forever.

116
00:17:57,216 --> 00:18:05,236
春に追いつくされても覚えていて
Even if spring catches up and overwhelms us, please remember.

117
00:18:14,416 --> 00:18:18,196
いつの間にか
Before I knew it,

118
00:18:18,686 --> 00:18:23,386
泣き方も忘れてた
I had even forgotten how to cry.

119
00:18:24,056 --> 00:18:28,106
空っぽの箱
An empty box,

120
00:18:28,446 --> 00:18:32,516
ひとりきりだった
I was all alone.

121
00:18:33,026 --> 00:18:36,586
さみしくて折れそうで
Lonely and ready to break,

122
00:18:36,936 --> 00:18:42,166
傷ついても愛してしまうの
even when hurt, I still end up loving.

123
00:18:42,526 --> 00:18:48,886
あきらめず探していてくれて
Thank you for searching for me without giving up.

124
00:18:49,056 --> 00:18:51,546
ありがとう
Thank you.

125
00:18:51,806 --> 00:18:59,906
あなたを待っていたのずっとここで
I've been waiting for you right here all this time.

126
00:19:00,346 --> 00:19:05,436
春に追いつくされても覚えていて
Even if spring catches up and overwhelms us, please remember.

127
00:19:22,866 --> 00:19:31,446
ひらひら舞い降りる雪がやさしいね
The fluttering, falling snow is so gentle, isn't it?

128
00:19:31,856 --> 00:19:40,936
いまこの瞬間 しあわせと名づけさせて
Let me name this very moment "happiness."

129
00:19:41,366 --> 00:19:50,066
あなたのために咲くよずっとここで
I will bloom just for you, right here forever.

130
00:19:50,436 --> 00:19:59,646
春に追いつくされても覚えていて
Even if spring catches up and overwhelms us, please remember.

131
00:20:00,945 --> 00:20:05,285
ここに咲いていること
What's blooming right here...

132
00:20:05,845 --> 00:20:09,285
覚えていて
Please remember it.

133
00:20:19,185 --> 00:20:22,805
君に出会うことができて、本当によかった。
I'm so glad I was able to meet you.

134
00:20:23,225 --> 00:20:29,145
これからも君の居場所になれるように いつでもふと思い出してもらえるように
From now on, so that I can be a place where you belong, and you can always remember me,

135
00:20:29,785 --> 00:20:32,525
ホロライブで、咲き続けるからね！
I'll keep blooming here in Hololive!

136
00:21:40,805 --> 00:21:43,245
[Title: 幽霊東京]
[Title: Ghost Tokyo]

137
00:21:46,105 --> 00:21:48,165
サンセット 輝く街の灯
Sunset, the lights of the shining city

138
00:21:48,645 --> 00:21:55,385
大衆的な僕を見下ろす あのビルの間を抜けて色づき出したネオン街って
Looking down on ordinary me, slipping between those buildings, the neon streets start to color up

139
00:21:55,945 --> 00:22:02,085
僕の時間とこの世界をトレード 夜に沈む
Trading my time and this world, sinking into the night

140
00:22:02,505 --> 00:22:06,065
終点でヒエジを辿る 僕の目に映る
Reflecting in my eyes tracing the route at the last stop

141
00:22:06,485 --> 00:22:10,765
ガラス窓にいたのは夢見た自分じゃなくて
What was in the glass window wasn't the me who had dreams

142
00:22:11,145 --> 00:22:18,105
今にも泣き出してしまいそうな暗闇の中 ひとりただ迷っている
Just wandering alone in the darkness that looks like it's about to start crying at any moment

143
00:22:18,605 --> 00:22:22,605
悲しい人 大丈夫 いつか大丈夫
Sad person, it's alright, it will be alright someday

144
00:22:22,845 --> 00:22:28,465
になるなんて思う日々をいくつ重ねた 今日だって
How many days have I stacked thinking like that, even today

145
00:22:28,845 --> 00:22:33,205
ひとり東京の景色に浸る 僕は幽霊みたいだ
Immersed in Tokyo's scenery alone, I'm like a ghost

146
00:22:34,165 --> 00:22:41,565
失うことに慣れてく中で 忘れてしまったあの願いさえも 思い出した時に
Even that wish I forgot while getting used to losing things, when I remembered it

147
00:22:41,745 --> 00:22:47,305
涙が落ちたのは この街がただ
The tears fell simply because this city

148
00:22:47,625 --> 00:22:52,285
あんまりにも眩しいから
Is too dazzling

149
00:22:52,585 --> 00:22:56,645
今日だって ひとり東京の景色に浸る 僕は幽霊みたいだ
Even today, immersed in Tokyo's scenery alone, I'm like a ghost

150
00:22:57,225 --> 00:23:01,385
こんな寂しい街で
In such a lonely city

151
00:23:01,585 --> 00:23:05,865
散々だ 手叩きながら嘆く日々の中
It's terrible, amid days of lamenting while clapping my hands

152
00:23:06,085 --> 00:23:11,225
あの日の思い出フラッシュバック 気づけば朝まで
Flashing back to the memories of that day, before I knew it until morning

153
00:23:11,505 --> 00:23:17,605
開くクローゼット 僕の言葉を音に乗せて 何度でも
Opening the closet, putting my words to sound, no matter how many times

154
00:23:17,925 --> 00:23:23,265
失うことに慣れてく中で 忘れてしまったあの日の日々でさえも
Even the days of that time I forgot while getting used to losing things

155
00:23:23,525 --> 00:23:31,005
それでもまだ先へ なんて思えるのは 君がいるから
Still being able to think "onward," is because you are here.

156
00:23:44,405 --> 00:23:51,265
なんて思えるのは 君がいるから
Being able to think that is because you are here.

157
00:23:51,845 --> 00:23:56,445
こんな寂しい街で
In such a lonely city

158
00:24:05,205 --> 00:24:08,205
散々だ 手叩きながら嘆く
It's terrible, lamenting while clapping my hands

159
00:24:09,405 --> 00:24:17,205
三千と輝く街の灯 大切な僕を見下ろす あのビルの先頭を伸ばして
Three thousand lights of the shining city, extending the tip of that building looking down on precious me

160
00:24:17,605 --> 00:24:23,005
あの日夢見た景色を覗いて 僕の時間とこの世界をトレード
Peering into the scenery I dreamed of that day, trading my time and this world

161
00:24:23,305 --> 00:24:25,845
明日を呼ぶ
Calling tomorrow

162
00:24:26,245 --> 00:24:32,205
失うことに慣れてく中で なくさずにいた 大切な思いを 抱きしめたら ふいに
While getting used to losing things, holding close the precious feelings I didn't lose, suddenly

163
00:24:36,605 --> 00:24:42,105
涙が落ちたのは この街でまだ 生きていたいと思うから
The tears fell because I still want to live in this city

164
00:24:55,845 --> 00:24:58,385
君もそうでしょう
You are the same, aren't you?

165
00:25:08,513 --> 00:25:12,273
真夜中の街を流れてく
Flowing through the midnight city...

166
00:25:12,623 --> 00:25:18,413
ビルをなぞって消える
...tracing the buildings and fading away.

167
00:25:19,643 --> 00:25:21,253
どこへゆくの？
Where are you heading?

168
00:25:21,643 --> 00:25:29,253
変わってゆくこと 気づいて 立ちどまった
I realized things were changing and stopped in my tracks.

169
00:25:30,083 --> 00:25:36,873
曖昧で不確かなもの 終わりあることだから
Because things are vague and uncertain, and bound to end...

170
00:25:38,313 --> 00:25:47,413
私は此処にある 君といる時間の中で呼吸をするんでしょう
I am right here. I must be breathing within the time spent with you.

171
00:25:48,113 --> 00:25:53,213
変わらないで、と 終わらないで、と
"Don't change," "Don't ever end,"

172
00:25:53,653 --> 00:25:58,353
今日も 夜明けを告げる
announcing the dawn once again today.

173
00:25:59,353 --> 00:26:05,653
輝いていたいたい こんな世界で愛う私を
I want to keep shining in a world like this, loving who I am.

174
00:26:06,183 --> 00:26:16,073
どうか暴かないで 君の隣で溶けて消えるまで 生きて
Please don't uncover it. Live until I melt away right by your side.

175
00:26:17,053 --> 00:26:22,553
揺らいだ切なさは いつかの朝に似てる
This wavering sorrow resembles a certain morning from the past.

176
00:26:27,513 --> 00:26:33,153
ひとりじゃない 瞬きの中 確かに触れた
I am not alone; amidst the blinking lights, I truly felt it.

177
00:26:35,653 --> 00:26:45,553
心の片隅 君の瞳に映る私を 焼き付けて
Burn into the corner of your heart the reflection of me in your eyes.

178
00:27:14,553 --> 00:27:23,953
その手で抱きしめて きっと誰よりも強く輝けるでしょう
Hold me tight in your arms; surely I can shine brighter than anyone else.

179
00:27:26,553 --> 00:27:36,453
変わりゆくもの 終わりゆくもの ひとつも漏らさずに 確かめていたい
Things changing, things ending—I want to confirm every single one without missing a thing.

180
00:27:40,453 --> 00:27:47,053
霞む世界に歌う私を どうか忘れないで
Please do not forget me as I sing in this hazy world.

181
00:27:47,653 --> 00:27:59,653
君の記憶の底へ 淡く甘く 滲んでひとつになって 漂うだけ
Fading softly and sweetly to the depths of your memory, becoming one and simply drifting.

182
00:28:00,453 --> 00:28:06,253
泣き出しそうな 夜の隙間を縫って
Threading through the gaps of a night that feels ready to cry,

183
00:28:06,653 --> 00:28:17,853
私は往く 夜明けのメロウ 君の隣で溶けて消えるまで 生きて
I go forth, the dawn's mellow, living until I melt away beside you.

184
00:28:26,653 --> 00:28:31,053
待ってたよね、たくさん。
You've been waiting for a long time, haven't you?

185
00:28:32,253 --> 00:28:38,953
うちさ、ファーストアルバムが出せるってなったとき、相当嬉しかったんだよ。
When I found out I could release my first album, I was so incredibly happy.

186
00:28:41,953 --> 00:28:58,153
歌うことは大好きだったけど、自信が正直なかったから、もうこれ以上うまく歌うことはないだろうなって、勝手に思っちゃっててさ。
I loved singing, but honestly I didn't have much confidence, so I just assumed I'd probably never be able to sing any better than that.

187
00:28:59,653 --> 00:29:05,253
でもね、君が待っててくれたから。
But you know, because you waited for me...

188
00:29:06,653 --> 00:29:16,253
うまくならないって思ってたのに、なんか成長したなって思うんだよね。
...even though I thought I wouldn't get any better, I feel like I've grown.

189
00:29:17,553 --> 00:29:32,653
よりいっそう歌が好きになれたんだ。気づかせてくれたのは、君だよ。
It made me love singing even more. The one who made me realize that is you.

190
00:29:52,353 --> 00:30:00,553
どこまでゆこうか ネイビーな夜空に 映る昨日の自分 夢見がちだった
How far shall I go? Into the navy night sky, the yesterday's self reflected... I was prone to daydreaming.

191
00:30:03,865 --> 00:30:07,265
深く深く紺になる
Deep into deep navy blue

192
00:30:07,265 --> 00:30:11,265
息を吸って今加速を
Take a breath and accelerate right now

193
00:30:11,265 --> 00:30:15,065
傷付く程に強くなると
Believing that the more it hurts, the stronger I'll become

194
00:30:15,065 --> 00:30:18,765
確かな色 動き出す
A definite color starts to move

195
00:30:18,765 --> 00:30:22,765
まとうよ その身体で
Wreathe yourself in it with that body

196
00:30:22,765 --> 00:30:26,265
鮮やかな夜空の果てへ
To the edge of the vibrant night sky

197
00:30:26,265 --> 00:30:28,265
忘れないように
So that you won't forget

198
00:30:28,265 --> 00:30:32,265
深く深く紺になる
Deep into deep navy blue

199
00:30:32,265 --> 00:30:35,765
今を生きる この加速を
This acceleration of living in the present

200
00:30:35,765 --> 00:30:39,265
光だって越えてゆける場所へ
To a place where even light can be surpassed

201
00:30:39,265 --> 00:30:42,265
強く強く踏み込んで
Stepping in strongly and firmly

202
00:30:42,265 --> 00:30:45,265
僕は駆ける ただ真っ直ぐに
I run forward, straight ahead

203
00:30:45,265 --> 00:30:49,765
譲れない想いを抱いて
Embracing feelings I won't surrender

204
00:31:02,065 --> 00:31:05,865
標識だらけの街を抜け出して
Slipping out of a town full of signposts

205
00:31:05,865 --> 00:31:09,265
明日を探してた
Searching for tomorrow

206
00:31:09,265 --> 00:31:13,065
常識も何も全部 雑踏と化してた
Common sense and everything else had turned into mere hustle and bustle

207
00:31:13,065 --> 00:31:16,265
どこまで行けるの
How far can I go?

208
00:31:16,265 --> 00:31:20,265
なんて聞き飽きた台詞吐いて
Uttering lines I'm sick of hearing

209
00:31:20,265 --> 00:31:26,265
曇った窓ガラスに書いた本音
My true feelings written on the fogged-up window glass

210
00:31:26,265 --> 00:31:28,265
すぐに指で消した
Immediately erased with my finger

211
00:31:28,265 --> 00:31:32,265
臆病でも揺るぎない軌跡
Even if cowardly, an unshakable trace

212
00:31:32,265 --> 00:31:36,265
確かない願いを 胸に遥か遠く
With a certain wish in my heart, far into the distance

213
00:31:36,265 --> 00:31:40,265
錆び付くようにきしんでも
Even if it creaks as if rusting

214
00:31:40,265 --> 00:31:44,265
この真っ暗を照らし進む
I'll push forward illuminating this pitch darkness

215
00:31:44,265 --> 00:31:48,265
ただ一つ 答えを追いかけて
Chasing after just one single answer

216
00:31:48,265 --> 00:31:54,265
もろくてもいい この腕で掴む為に
Even if fragile, to grasp it with these arms

217
00:31:54,265 --> 00:32:00,265
手を伸ばすよ 打ち鳴らす鼓動の限り
I reach out my hand, as far as my beating heart resonates

218
00:32:26,865 --> 00:32:31,265
何度 この道で迷って
No matter how many times I got lost on this road

219
00:32:31,265 --> 00:32:36,265
見失って どこへ行くの
Losing my way, where am I heading?

220
00:32:36,265 --> 00:32:41,265
目指す場所も その意味も
Both the place I aim for and its meaning

221
00:32:41,265 --> 00:32:45,265
一つしかないのに
Even though there is only one

222
00:32:45,265 --> 00:32:50,265
曇った確かさは 夜に溶けてももう一度
Even if clouded certainty melts into the night, once more

223
00:32:50,265 --> 00:32:54,265
ひらけてゆく 視界の先
Opening up ahead in my field of vision

224
00:32:54,265 --> 00:33:00,265
僕を連れて行くよ きっと
It will surely lead me away

225
00:33:03,065 --> 00:33:07,265
深く深く紺になる
Deep into deep navy blue

226
00:33:07,265 --> 00:33:11,265
息を吸って今 加速を
Take a breath and accelerate right now

227
00:33:11,265 --> 00:33:15,265
傷付く程に強くなると
Believing that the more it hurts, the stronger I'll become

228
00:33:15,265 --> 00:33:19,265
確かな色 動き出す
A definite color starts to move

229
00:33:19,265 --> 00:33:23,265
まとうよ その身体で
Wreathe yourself in it with that body

230
00:33:23,265 --> 00:33:27,265
鮮やかな夜空の果てへ
To the edge of the vibrant night sky

231
00:33:27,265 --> 00:33:28,265
忘れないように
So that you won't forget

232
00:33:28,265 --> 00:33:32,265
深く深く紺になる
Deep into deep navy blue

233
00:33:32,265 --> 00:33:36,265
今を生きる この加速を
This acceleration of living in the present

234
00:33:36,265 --> 00:33:40,265
光だって越えてゆける場所へ
To a place where even light can be surpassed

235
00:33:40,265 --> 00:33:44,265
強く強く踏み込んで
Stepping in strongly and firmly

236
00:33:44,265 --> 00:33:48,265
僕は駆ける ただ真っ直ぐに
I run forward, straight ahead

237
00:33:48,265 --> 00:33:52,265
譲れない想いを抱いて
Embracing feelings I won't surrender

238
00:33:52,265 --> 00:33:58,265
止まらないで 走り続ける意味を知るから
Don't stop, because I know the meaning of continuing to run

239
00:34:23,865 --> 00:34:30,265
心地よい晴れ空 今日は何をして遊ぼうか
A pleasant clear sky, what shall we play and do today?

240
00:34:30,265 --> 00:34:37,265
いつまでも変わらない 雲を追いかけてみようか
Shall we chase the clouds that never change?

241
00:34:37,265 --> 00:34:43,265
はしゃぎ回って疲れて お腹もすいて寝転んで
Running around and getting tired, getting hungry and lying down

242
00:34:43,265 --> 00:34:49,265
明日はもっといい日になりそう 一緒だよ
Tomorrow looks like it'll be an even better day, we're together!

243
00:34:49,265 --> 00:34:55,265
いつもキラキラ毎日止まらないでしょ
Every day sparkles and never stops, right?

244
00:34:55,265 --> 00:35:00,775
やりたいこと全部遊び尽くしても
Even if we play through everything we want to do

245
00:35:01,098 --> 00:35:09,308
やりたいこと全部遊び尽くしても今はまだ知らないことたくさんあるけど
Even if we play to our heart's content, there are still so many things we don't know yet,

246
00:35:10,448 --> 00:35:18,428
君と君と手を取ってずっと笑えるといいよね
holding hands with you, I hope we can keep smiling forever.

247
00:35:30,128 --> 00:35:36,108
朝までしゃべり込んで眠くなる日もあったよね
There were days we talked until morning and got sleepy,

248
00:35:36,948 --> 00:35:42,648
ささやかな悩みさえも笑いに変えてくれたよね
and you turned even our little worries into laughter.

249
00:35:43,848 --> 00:35:53,108
たまに怒ってうつむいて励まし合って乗り越えて一人じゃできないことでも
Sometimes getting upset or hanging our heads, but encouraging each other to push through—even things we couldn't do alone,

250
00:35:53,928 --> 00:36:01,168
二人ならほらね？ワクワクすること止まらないでしょ
with the two of us, see? The excitement never stops, right?

251
00:36:01,848 --> 00:36:08,528
やりたいこと叶える力があるよ
We have the power to make our dreams come true.

252
00:36:09,548 --> 00:36:15,408
そうでしょう？ときめくココロに色づく毎日
Right? Every day colors our fluttering hearts.

253
00:36:16,168 --> 00:36:24,048
君と君と手を取って「今」を重ね続けてこう
Holding hands with you, let's keep stacking up the 'now'.

254
00:36:24,808 --> 00:36:34,968
笑顔の帰り道も何年経っても君とならずっと…
Even on the way back home smiling, no matter how many years pass, with you forever...

255
00:36:49,648 --> 00:36:56,108
いつまでだって続くんだどこまでだって行けそうだ
It will go on forever, and we feel like we can go anywhere.

256
00:36:57,028 --> 00:37:02,128
友達なんて言葉じゃ足りないよ
A word like 'friends' just isn't enough.

257
00:37:02,908 --> 00:37:08,388
いつもそばで支えてくれてありがとう
Thank you for always supporting me by my side.

258
00:37:09,088 --> 00:37:15,028
一緒に笑い合ってくれてありがとう
Thank you for sharing laughs with me.

259
00:37:16,128 --> 00:37:21,828
今はまだ知らないことたくさんあるけど
Even though there are still so many things we don't know yet,

260
00:37:22,868 --> 00:37:28,688
君と君と手を取って転んで泣きそうな時も
holding hands with you, even when we stumble and feel like crying,

261
00:37:29,188 --> 00:37:36,088
君と君と明日もずっと笑えるといいよね
I hope we can keep smiling together tomorrow and always.

262
00:37:37,848 --> 00:37:50,008
これからもね よろしくどうぞ
Here's to looking forward to working together from now on too.

263
00:37:59,505 --> 00:38:07,925
皆さんお待ちかね！活動5周年記念フルセット、記念グッズはこちらとなっておりまーす！
Everyone's been waiting for it! The 5th anniversary full goods set and commemorative items are right here!

264
00:38:08,225 --> 00:38:18,665
はーい、こんな感じのフルセットですね。いやぁ、泉パパのイラストが今回も光っております！
Yay, here's what the full set looks like. Izumi-papa's illustrations are shining brightly this time as well!

265
00:38:18,945 --> 00:38:24,705
では1個ずつグッズを紹介させてもらいます。まずはおなじみ、描き下ろしのパブミラー！
Let's introduce the goods one by one. First off, the familiar, newly drawn pub mirror!

266
00:38:24,805 --> 00:38:48,645
パブミラーって一体なんだって思ってる人も結構多いと思うんですけど、パブミラーは、うーん、イラストの背景がなんか鏡になってて高級感があって、特別な感じの、えっと、インテリアみたいな感じなのかな？で、今回アクリルスタンドとはまた別に、えっと高級感、特別感を出したくてパブミラーを出してみました。皆さんのおうちに飾ってみてください！
I think quite a few people might be wondering what a pub mirror actually is. Well, the background of the illustration is sort of like a mirror, giving it a luxurious, special, interior-decor-like feel. This time, separate from the acrylic stand, I wanted to create a luxurious and special vibe, so I decided to make a pub mirror. Please try displaying it in your homes!

267
00:38:49,145 --> 00:39:15,105
そしてお次はミオシャとおでかけコインケース！こちらは、みんながイベントに行くときによくこう、コインを使うんじゃないかと思って、そのコインを出し入れするためだけの、コインケースがあったら便利なんじゃないかなと思い、作ってみました。このコインケースと一緒にイベントに行ってくれたら、うちはとっても嬉しいなー！
And next up is the Mio-sha Out-and-About Coin Case! I figured everyone often uses coins when going to events, and thought it would be convenient to have a coin case exclusively for putting coins in and taking them out. So I made one. I would be super happy if you take this coin case with you to events!

268
00:39:17,265 --> 00:39:45,045
ではお次、ミオシャ思い出フォトフレーム！こちらは、うちがいつも特典でつけてるポストカードを入れてちょうどいい感じのフォトフレームを作ってみました。うーん、またね、このシカタナイ先生の描き下ろしなんですけど、コインケースもね、描き下ろししていただいたんですが、え、とっても可愛いですね。ぜひぜひこちらのなかにポストカードを飾っておうちで眺めてみてくださいね！
Next up, the Mio-sha Memory Photo Frame! I made this photo frame to be just the right size to hold the postcards I usually include as bonus items. It features brand new artwork by Shikatai-sensei—the coin case also has new art by them—and it's super cute. Please decorate it with the postcard and admire it at home!

269
00:39:46,165 --> 00:39:59,775
はい、そして最後がミオファの森の住民カードー！こちらはですね、ミオファの森の住民のみんなが、うん、ミオファの森内での、え、身分証明に使えように作ってみました。何言ってるのか
And lastly, the Miofa Forest Resident Card! I made this so that everyone who is a resident of Miofa Forest can use it as ID within Miofa Forest. Wait, what am I even saying...

270
00:40:01,314 --> 00:40:02,634
分かんないと思うけどね
You probably won't know this, but...

271
00:40:02,934 --> 00:40:17,014
はい ちなみにシリアル番号は えーと それぞれ入っているんですけれども えー シリアル番号全員が違うので 世界に1つだけ 1枚だけのカードとなっておりますので ぜひみおふぁのみんなはゲットしてみてください
Right, each card comes with a unique serial number. Since everyone's serial number is different, it's a one-of-a-kind card in the entire world, so Miofa, make sure to get your hands on one!

272
00:40:18,094 --> 00:40:25,514
そして最後に このグッズのフルセットを買ってもらうと 特典が2つあります！
And finally, if you purchase the full goods set, there are two special bonuses!

273
00:40:26,394 --> 00:40:36,114
大神ミオ直筆サイン＆複製メッセージ入りポストカード 泉パパかっこよろしのポストカード イェーイ 長い長い！
An Ookami Mio hand-signed & duplicated message postcard, and an amazingly cool postcard by Papa Izumi! Yay, that's a long name!

274
00:40:36,994 --> 00:40:45,554
えーと うちが直筆のサインを入れて さらに箱推しの…箱推しじゃない 箱推しのメッセージが入ったポストカードとなっております
Um, it features my hand-written signature plus a message for all you oshi-generalists... no, not oshi-generalists, a message for fans who love supporting all of us!

275
00:40:46,194 --> 00:40:54,574
泉パパのイラストで さっきのパブミラーのイラストなんだけど ちょっと差分で表情が違ったりするので ぜひぜひこちらも手に入れてください
It uses an illustration by Papa Izumi—it's the same as the pub mirror, but with a slightly different expression, so definitely make sure to get this one too!

276
00:40:55,234 --> 00:41:04,894
そしてお次が 特典2つめ 特典ボイス 「5周年の後もキミと一緒に！」というテーマでシチュエーションボイスを撮らせていただきました！
And next is the second bonus: a situation voice drama titled "With You Even After the 5th Anniversary!"

277
00:41:05,394 --> 00:41:19,234
もうちょっといつもね あのボイス録るの少し恥ずかしいんだけれども 5年間一緒に過ごしてくれたみんなに感謝の気持ちを込めて シチュエーションボイス台本から考えたので ぜひぜひちょっとこっぱずかしいですが聞いてください
I always feel a little embarrassed recording voice dramas, but I put a lot of gratitude into this script for everyone who spent these 5 years with me, so please give it a listen, even if it's a bit cringy!

278
00:41:20,294 --> 00:41:21,854
はあー
*sigh*

279
00:41:22,734 --> 00:41:26,014
さて グッズ告知も終わったね
Well, that wraps up the goods announcements.

280
00:41:27,014 --> 00:41:30,694
けど なんかもの足りないな
But... something still feels missing.

281
00:41:31,374 --> 00:41:34,854
キミも なんか短いなって思ってない？
Don't you think it felt a bit short too?

282
00:41:36,194 --> 00:41:38,614
あー そっか！
Ah, right!

283
00:41:39,634 --> 00:41:42,254
もの足りないなら もう1回 5年目いっとく？
If it's not enough, should we go for a second round of Year 5?

284
00:41:46,194 --> 00:41:51,394
ここだけの話 ライブのタイトルの ナイトループってあるじゃん？
Just between us, you know the live's title, "Night Loop"?

285
00:41:52,154 --> 00:41:56,534
あれって気づいてたかもしれないけど 曲名なんだよね
You might have already figured it out, but that's actually the song title.

286
00:41:59,014 --> 00:42:03,814
この夢のようなライブが終わった後に なんとMVも公開されちゃいます！
And after this dream-like live concert ends, the MV will also be released!

287
00:42:06,154 --> 00:42:12,574
じゃあ 心の準備はいい？ いくよ！ ナイトループ！
So, are you mentally prepared? Here we go! Night Loop!

288
00:42:27,904 --> 00:42:31,144
相変わらず絵ばかり見ておかしくなる やりたくもって
I keep staring at the same old pictures until I'm losing my mind...

289
00:42:31,144 --> 00:42:34,624
二人掛けのソファに背を向け 色あせた過去とやり合ってんだ
Turning my back on the two-seater sofa, fighting with the faded past.

290
00:42:34,624 --> 00:42:38,184
抑えつけるほどに風を増していく 劣等感そのほか諸々諸々
The more I suppress it, the more the wind grows—inferiority complex and all the rest.

291
00:42:38,184 --> 00:42:41,204
襲われる前に夜を染め上げなきゃ
Before it overwhelms me, I've got to dye the night!

292
00:42:47,904 --> 00:42:51,284
敵じゃないポーズ決め込んで 熊さんぽけ詰め込んで
Striking a pose like it's no enemy, stuffing my pockets with bear plushies.

293
00:42:51,284 --> 00:42:54,824
叩き割ったらば古いの ひとつまたひとつも飲み込めないくらい
If I smash them all, one old thing after another, more than I can swallow—

294
00:42:54,824 --> 00:42:58,244
ほら あげてやるよ食うを 全部ちゃんと噛んで味わいながら
Look, I'll give it to you to eat, chewing and savoring every bit of it properly.

295
00:42:58,244 --> 00:43:01,444
感想聞いてみてもいいですか
Would it be okay to ask for your thoughts?

296
00:43:03,624 --> 00:43:09,604
僕ら葉を背負ったまま ナイトループだ そう 壊れるまで
Carrying our leaves on our backs, it's a night loop, yes, until it breaks down.

297
00:43:09,604 --> 00:43:14,484
羅針ぎゅっとしたサイコルールじゃ もう縛れないよ 正解すら間違っているんだ
With psych-rules hugging the compass tight, I'm not tied down anymore; even the right answers are wrong.

298
00:43:14,484 --> 00:43:17,624
そうだろう 誰も彼も馬鹿みたい
Isn't that right? Everyone's acting like fools.

299
00:43:17,624 --> 00:43:22,864
痛いの飛んでいけナイトループだ そう 上がれるまで やいやいのどうしようもないから
Pain, fly away, it's a night loop, yes, until we can rise up, since we can't do a thing about all this noise.

300
00:43:22,864 --> 00:43:26,224
もう語らないで あと少しで
Don't talk anymore, just a little longer—

301
00:43:26,224 --> 00:43:31,144
絶望と希望の境界線 背伸びすれば届きそうな称賛
The boundary line of despair and hope, applause that seems within reach if I stand on my toes.

302
00:43:31,144 --> 00:43:46,144
あうだうだ 脱線したい
Blah blah blah, I want to derail!

303
00:43:47,744 --> 00:43:51,284
うわって声も出しちゃって 目眩しちゃってへこみ散らすまでがワセット
Screaming "Whoa!", getting dizzy, wearing myself down until I cave—that's the set.

304
00:43:51,284 --> 00:43:54,444
やる気アンデッド 毎日がニューな己のバースデー
Motivation undead, every day is my new personal birthday.

305
00:43:54,444 --> 00:43:57,684
諦めても諦めなくても 僕を置いて進んでく時間
Whether I give up or not, time marches on, leaving me behind.

306
00:43:57,684 --> 00:44:00,684
抜け出せないなら 乗るしかないじゃんしゃあないなあ
If I can't escape, I have no choice but to ride along, oh well!

307
00:44:01,404 --> 00:44:07,324
沸いてこないほらナイトループだ もう止まらないね 変になったのどっちなんだか
Boiling up, see, it's a night loop, it won't stop anymore—which one of us went crazy?

308
00:44:07,324 --> 00:44:14,324
さっぱりわからないね あさって前で巻き戻って期待の延長戦 1か8か 参加夜か
I haven't the slightest clue. Rewinding right before the day after tomorrow, extra time of expectations, all or nothing, join the night.

309
00:44:15,184 --> 00:44:19,084
最後に笑うためだ 好きだけ泣いて抗おうか
To be able to laugh at the end, let's cry as much as we want and fight back.

310
00:44:19,084 --> 00:44:22,084
元の自分が未来から手を振っている
My former self is waving from the future.

311
00:44:22,084 --> 00:44:26,084
行こうぜ未知その先へ アンダースタンド
Let's go to the unknown beyond, understand?

312
00:44:26,544 --> 00:44:33,104
まだ夜は明けない 燻るネオンサイン 不安気消そうぜ
The night hasn't broken yet, smoldering neon signs—let's blow away the anxiety!

313
00:44:33,104 --> 00:44:39,904
まだ夢は覚めない 笑う疑問符 今打ち消そうぜ
The dream hasn't woken up yet, laughing question marks—let's erase them now!

314
00:44:40,724 --> 00:44:47,164
僕ら灰を背負ったまま ナイトループだ そう 壊れるまで 羅針ぎゅっとしたサイコルールじゃ もう縛れないよ
Carrying our ashes on our backs, it's a night loop, yes, until it breaks down, with psych-rules hugging the compass tight, I'm not tied down anymore!

315
00:44:47,164 --> 00:44:53,164
正解すら間違っているんだ そうだろう 誰も彼も馬鹿みたい
Even the right answers are wrong, isn't that right? Everyone's acting like fools.

316
00:44:53,604 --> 00:45:00,004
痛いの飛んでいけナイトループだ そう 上がれるまで やいやいのどうしようもないから
Pain, fly away, it's a night loop, yes, until we can rise up, since we can't do a thing about all this noise.

317
00:45:55,029 --> 00:46:01,709
君はこのループから抜け出したい…
You want to break out of this loop...

318
00:46:07,939 --> 00:46:14,159
君はこのループを抜け出すことを選んだんだね…
You chose to break out of this loop...

319
00:46:15,149 --> 00:46:16,509
そっか…
I see...

320
00:46:17,879 --> 00:46:21,959
じゃあうちと6年目を始めよう！
Then let's start our sixth year together!

321
00:46:23,979 --> 00:46:25,849
なんだかワクワクしてきた。
I'm getting kind of excited.

322
00:46:27,999 --> 00:46:29,889
最後にもう1曲だけ、
Just one last song,

323
00:46:30,889 --> 00:46:32,069
アンコール
for the encore...

324
00:46:33,039 --> 00:46:34,269
聞いてね。
Please listen to it.

325
00:46:35,599 --> 00:46:36,619
シリオス…
Sirios...

326
00:46:37,239 --> 00:46:38,309
違う、シリウス！
No, Sirius!

327
00:46:41,365 --> 00:46:47,295
ごめんね ありがとう 声にしてみても
Even when I try to voice "I'm sorry" and "Thank you"

328
00:46:47,875 --> 00:46:54,305
届かない 戻らない あの日の僕らは
They don't reach, they won't return, we of that day

329
00:46:54,465 --> 00:47:03,215
かじかむ手 繋いで 朝に怯えて 震えていた
Held our numbing hands together, frightened of the morning, trembling

330
00:47:07,855 --> 00:47:13,945
失さないで と 消ないで と 願っても
Even if I pray "Don't lose it" and "Don't fade away"

331
00:47:15,105 --> 00:47:27,365
色褪せていく 記憶の欠片 抱きしめ 眠るよ
I hold close the fading fragments of memory and sleep...

332
00:47:28,325 --> 00:47:33,305
逢いたい ただ、願うほどに
I want to see you... The more I wish for it,

333
00:47:33,565 --> 00:47:40,815
目を閉じて 描いた 永遠の夢の中 いつかの
Closing my eyes, inside the eternal dream I envisioned, someday...

334
00:47:41,355 --> 00:47:47,505
君を 探し続けてる
I keep searching for you.

335
00:47:48,335 --> 00:47:57,485
僕はまだ あの夜をひとり 歩こう
I will still walk that night alone...

336
00:47:58,945 --> 00:48:04,965
呼吸も 温度も 失した世界に
In a world where both breath and warmth were lost

337
00:48:05,355 --> 00:48:11,415
約束は 今も 美しいままで
The promise remains as beautiful as ever

338
00:48:11,815 --> 00:48:21,855
夜空に咲いている 君の声だけ 聞こえないよ
Blooming in the night sky, only your voice is something I cannot hear...

339
00:48:25,785 --> 00:48:31,165
ここにいるのに 叫ぶのに 夜はまた
Though I'm here, though I'm shouting, the night once again

340
00:48:31,645 --> 00:48:43,365
隠してしまう 優しい嘘で 包んで 遠くして
Hides it away, wrapping it in a gentle lie, pushing it far away...

341
00:48:45,845 --> 00:48:51,665
「またあした」も 言えないままで
Without even being able to say "See you tomorrow"

342
00:48:51,925 --> 00:49:05,225
彼方へとゆく 君を想うよ もう一度だけ 笑いかけて
I think of you heading to the far side... Smile at me just one more time.

343
00:49:06,005 --> 00:49:12,655
きっとなお それだけで 僕は
Surely, just with that, I...

344
00:49:13,455 --> 00:49:25,405
止まっていた 季節が解けるように やがて 夜は明けるから
Just as the stopped seasons thaw, eventually the night will dawn, so

345
00:49:26,395 --> 00:49:32,775
動き出す 時がふたりを分かつ遠く
The time that starts moving separates the two of us far apart.

346
00:49:33,005 --> 00:49:43,335
離れても 心は 繋げて
Even if we are far apart, keep our hearts connected...

347
00:50:12,688 --> 00:50:15,988
さよなら こぼれた涙は
Goodbye... The spilled tears...

348
00:50:19,738 --> 00:50:27,338
君がゆく あの空を飾るよ 迷わないように
Will adorn the sky you walk, so you won't get lost.

349
00:50:30,638 --> 00:50:37,838
輝いてて いつまでも 忘れない君を
Keep shining bright... I will never forget you.

350
00:50:40,338 --> 00:50:43,338
追うよ
I'll chase after you...

351
00:50:43,838 --> 00:50:47,838
明日も歌うよ
Singing tomorrow as well...

352
00:50:49,838 --> 00:50:53,338
明日は
Tomorrow...

353
00:50:53,838 --> 00:51:00,338
愛しい 願い程に
As much as my dearest wish...

354
00:51:00,838 --> 00:51:06,838
僕らまた 巡り合う日まで
Until the day we meet again.

355
00:51:08,338 --> 00:51:13,838
おやすみ
Good night...

356
00:52:47,838 --> 00:53:15,777
[Text: 5周年ありがとう!! ここまで来られたのは、駆け抜けた5年間でね✨ 今こうしてホロライブにいられるのは君の応援があったからだよ。本当にありがとう、これからもいっぱいいっしょに遊ぼうね♪ 大神ミオ]
[Text: Thank you for 5 years!! Making it this far through these past 5 rushing years✨ The reason I can be here in Hololive now is because of your support. Thank you so much, let's keep playing together a lot more♪ Ookami Mio]

